          the multifunction device RCU (Reset controller unit) [0] which
          is not the case. Hardware wise there is only one reset
          controller and it is RCU which is not a multi function device.
          intel-reset-syscon.c is defined as per the hardware. </tt><tt><br>
        </tt> </p>
